# Syncthing Connection Troubleshooting

## Checklist
- [x] Open Syncthing dashboard (http://localhost:8384)
- [x] Click 'Actions' (작업)
- [x] Click 'Restart' (재시작)
- [x] Wait for page refresh and 'upload2601' reconnection
- [x] Wait 30 seconds
- [ ] Check transfer speed for 'upload2601'
- [ ] Report results

## Findings
- Syncthing restarted successfully.
- 'upload2601' reconnected.
- Current speed: Download 1 B/s, Upload 2 B/s.
- Connection type: TCP LAN.
- Remaining data: ~110 GiB (5,747 items).
